meta {
  name: demo
}

docs {
  TRZ-38 against a running API with DEMO_MODE=true on a database that holds the cohort and ran
  make seed-demo, with ANALYST_DEMO_PASSWORD in bruno/.env. It resets the demo: run it before a
  walkthrough, not in the middle of one.
  01 to 03: the analyst session; the database can be reset; a reset without its key is 422.
  04 to 06: the persona signs in with the invented document DNI DEMO-MX-0001; a customer
  session cannot reset (403).
  07 to 09: a reset creates the 22 simulated cases again; the same key resets once; the queue
  shows the three seeded escalations, each marked simulated.
}
